  "title": "FOUNDCOG attention and data quality: code and attentive-state tags accompanying \"Awake Infant Functional MRI For Visual Neuroscience: Reflections from the Foundations of Cognition Project\"",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "<p>Code and anonymised attentive-state tags (ELAN) from the FOUNDCOG project, reproducing the head-motion figures (Figure 3D–F, Supplementary Figure 4) and attentive-state figures (Figure 5 B–F) of Dineen et al. (2026), Frontiers in Neuroscience. Motion analyses use framewise displacement from OpenNeuro ds006883. Code and outputs: BSD 3-Clause; tags and run metadata: CC BY 4.0; example videos: CC BY-NC-ND 4.0.</p>",
